<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 63 0 R
/E (Isolation levels define how and when changes made by one transaction become visible to others. Postgres defaults to Read Committed, which is usually what you want. However, for ultra-sensitive operations like generating a bank statement, you might need Serializable to prevent "Phantom Reads".)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
