<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 63 0 R
/E (Higher isolation levels provide more consistency but decrease performance by increasing the number of locks. As a senior, you must choose the lowest level of isolation that safely maintains your business requirements.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
